      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咱的饭量本来就小，最近还吃啥都犯恶心。\r\n好像脚也比以前变得更重了，\r\n所以咱打算暂时休息一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9cdccb83d8faa99591c71ec5082cddef3a6162bcc0e69ccd66b9ccbe6381264",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
