      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这大概是身体发来的信号，它在提醒咱现在差不\r\n多是退役的时候了……吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9ada67d0389040331da532e897b84cc0c77140cb8960370c26f14af4b185f99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
