      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎，这种事儿对运动员而言也算是很常见啦。\r\n做事儿嘛，讲究个不愧于心，\r\n咱再和自个儿的身体好好谈谈再做决定吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44958464b8dea7babac775beb91dd79155a66b45714e6cc31532aa9f8e22c146",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
