      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也在网上看过那场见面会了……\r\n要真的退役了的话，以后赛场会变得寂寞的吧～\r\n明明她好不容易才把气氛炒热——",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2a2e9e25ca26b591fde833a1ce8143ff165a2db82e69010a1a06f7321dcc52a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
